{"version":1,"content":"<p>上周辭去英偉達行政總裁一職後，黃仁勳發佈首次公開聲明。黃仁勳寫道：「我給董事會造成麻煩，對此我深感懊悔。我完全承擔自己犯下的錯誤，並承諾全力配合董事會的獨立調查。」黃仁勳稱，自己收到不少投資者與員工的支持，願意回歸行政總裁崗位，帶領公司應對 「複雜的技術、市場、競爭以及地緣政治局勢」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586842.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T21:21:09.587422+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T20:56:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T21:14:14.878064+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T21:14:14.878064+00:00","content_hash":"544ec7dfb14e96646de0d78f10df57bca2df7f6a025a25af1ee01cb5cbaf2f8a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}